<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB to continue providing liquidity cash.</title>
<headline>SNB to continue providing liquidity cash.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss National Bank vice-chairman Jean-Pierre Roth said the central bank would continue to inject liquidity into the money market to ease upward pressure on the Swiss franc.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no intention of changing policy. We've been very active today, we are ready to give liquidity. We've pushed the interst rates down,&quot; he told reporters at a business seminar.</p>
</text>
